  <name>Yestream</name>
  <developer_name>Yestream</developer_name>
  <update_contact>support@yestream.ai.studio</update_contact>
  <summary>IPTV player for M3U, Xtream Codes, and Stalker portals</summary>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">yestream.desktop</launchable>

  <description>
    <p>Yestream is a cross-platform IPTV player for user-supplied playlists and portal connections.</p>
    <p>It supports M3U and M3U8 playlists, Xtream Codes API, and Stalker portals with EPG, catch-up, favorites, and external player integration.</p>
    <p>The app does not include channels, playlists, or media catalogs. Any IPTV sources, logos, metadata, and programme information come from services the user configures.</p>
  </description>

